<title>USA: Ruidoso MSD 3, N.M., won by Harris Trust.</title>
<headline>Ruidoso MSD 3, N.M., won by Harris Trust.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harris Trust &amp; Savings Bank said it won $5 million of Ruidoso MSD 3, N.M., general obligation Series May 1, 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.32 percent.</p>
